  "protocol": "Fresh sequential subprocess for each cached/uncached angle-count configuration. Cache preparation occurs once after loading and before reconstruction profiling. Each profile excludes one full warmup, times repeated reconstruction calls without RSS sampling, then samples RSS during a separate extra call. Cache preparation time is measured but its temporary peak RSS is not sampled.",
